menu "Deskstrate core"

    config DESKSTRATE_DDC_TOGGLE_TEST
        bool "Toggle-test DDC1 lines at boot"
        default n
        help
            Before starting I2C, drives SDA then SCL low/high for 3 s each (2 cycles)
            so you can follow them with a meter on HDMI pins 16/15.

    config DESKSTRATE_SIMULATE
        bool "Simulate monitors and hubs"
        default n
        help
            Both monitors and both USB hubs act as present without any DDC or SWD
            traffic: switches only update the core's state. For testing the web UI,
            the UDP protocol and the deck without the real hardware attached.

    config DESKSTRATE_SWD_BRINGUP
        bool "Log hub SWD state at boot"
        default n
        help
            Connects to both USB hubs over SWD and logs each one's SW-DP IDCODE and
            selection state once at boot. Read-only: it never writes the request byte.
            Use it to confirm SWD wiring and the per-build status-word address before
            trusting switching.

endmenu
